# spec: SETGET [1.11] sidetone is [persist, mode]; low is mode 3, written to persist.
# source: NOTES.md SETGET table ([1.11] 2 bytes: [persist, mode], 3 = low); the reply is synthetic, the captured [1.11] layout with mode 3
device qc_ultra2
call set_sidetone low
send 01 0b 02 02 01 03
recv 01 0b 03 03 01 03 0f
result ok
